{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_042570","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"河里真的有Basilisco吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"我只是听说有人在那条河里也见过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"要是在尼加拉瓜，我倒知道几个经常能见到它们的地方。想看看吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我又不是来观光的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"你不喜欢蜥蜴？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"也不是不喜欢。不过蛇更好吃。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"……我又没问味道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"你呢？你喜欢吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"也不是特别喜欢……不过蜥蜴很像恐龙，不觉得很帅吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"毕竟都是<R=爬行动物,REPTILE>。但体型差得太多。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=爬行动物,REPTILE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"肯定也还有大家伙。听说<R=哺乳动物,MAMMAL>大量繁衍，还吃恐龙蛋，但我不觉得恐龙会因此灭绝。它们一定还生活在世界的某个角落。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=哺乳动物,MAMMAL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":176,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"恐龙蛋吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"而且生物不是一直都在进化吗？也许它们进化成了让人根本看不出是恐龙的样子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"那样的话，已经不能叫恐龙了吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"也是啊……。果然恐龙就得够大才行！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""}]}